            "paragraph_1": "<p>Dude sat there on the harbour wall, staring out to sea. He kicked off his flip flops and reclined, feeling dozy in the warm sunshine. What a place. A while later his eye was drawn to an object bobbing in the waves. At first he thought it might have been a seal, or even a dolphin, but it wasn't. A mass of tangled rope, nets and fishing line. Ugh, that's horrible thought Dude, we humans really should do better.</p>",
