        },
        "text_inspiration": {
          "type": "text_row",
          "settings": {
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "overlap_enabled": false,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>The moment though, resonated with Dude and some months later, when he started to design his own socks, the memory of that floating heap of plastic, ruining the ocean, inspired him to do better. He swore that he'd only source materials that could decompose or be recycled. Organic cotton and bamboo would be the mainstays and packaging would be plastic free.</p>",
            "paragraph_1_style": "body",
            "paragraph_1_rotation": 1.5,
            "paragraph_1_rotation_mobile": 0,
            "paragraph_2": "<p>Doris &amp; Dude was born</p>",
