            "text_alignment": "center",
            "overlap_enabled": false,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Now, selling 100,000 pair of socks every year, Doris &amp; Dude still works to the same ethical standards. We produce all of our socks in regularly audited European factories, all of our socks are made using certified organic cotton &amp; bamboo and our designs are dominated and inspired by nature.</p>",
